@host = http://localhost:5080
@token = dev-only-token-change-me

### List users (page 1, 20 per page)
GET {{host}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List users, custom paging
GET {{host}}/api/users?page=1&pageSize=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invalid paging (400)
GET {{host}}/api/users?pageSize=1000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get user by ID
GET {{host}}/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get missing user (404)
GET {{host}}/api/users/999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create user
POST {{host}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Alan",
  "lastName": "Turing",
  "email": "alan@techhive.example",
  "department": "IT"
}

### Create invalid user (400)
POST {{host}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "",
  "email": "not-an-email"
}

### Update user
PUT {{host}}/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ada",
  "lastName": "King",
  "email": "ada@techhive.example",
  "department": "Engineering"
}

### Delete user
DELETE {{host}}/api/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Email without a domain suffix (400)
POST {{host}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "A", "lastName": "B", "email": "a@b", "department": "IT" }

### Malformed JSON (400)
POST {{host}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{bad

### Duplicate email, different case (409)
POST {{host}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "X", "lastName": "Y", "email": "ADA@techhive.example", "department": "IT" }

### No token (401)
GET {{host}}/api/users

### Wrong token (401)
GET {{host}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer not-a-real-token

### Public status page (no token needed)
GET {{host}}/
